      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Once affected individuals are identified, platelet mass in these patients should be evaluated via PCT; if this value falls below the reference interval, a concurrent pathologic thrombocytopenia may be present.",
